%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrap": false, "width": 150, "actorMargin": 50, "messageMargin": 40}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as AuthController
    participant V as Validation aspect
    participant P as Auth provider
    participant JS as JwtService
    participant DB as MySQL
    U->>A: GET /api/csrf-token/public
    A-->>U: CSRF token and cookie
    Note over U,A: Send X-XSRF-TOKEN on every POST
    U->>A: POST /api/auth/register/public
    A->>V: Before advice
    V->>V: Breached-password and duplicate checks
    V-->>A: OK, or 400 with errors
    A->>DB: Save user, BCrypt hash, role JOB_SEEKER
    U->>A: POST /api/auth/login/public
    A->>P: Authenticate email and password
    P->>DB: Load user by email
    P->>P: Compare with BCrypt hash
    P-->>A: Authenticated with authorities
    A->>JS: Generate token
    JS-->>A: Signed JWT
    A-->>U: 200 with message, user, jwtToken
